---
import Base from "~/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy policy · leavemaxxing" description="What leavemaxxing stores, what it measures, and what it never collects.">
  <article class="card mx-auto mt-2 max-w-3xl p-6 sm:p-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold sm:text-4xl">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Last updated 17 October 2026</p>
    <div class="prose-lm mt-6">
      <p>leavemaxxing has no accounts and no server that can read your plans. Here is everything the site does with data.</p>

      <h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
      <p>The site uses your browser's local storage for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>your last plan, so it's there when you come back;</li>
        <li>plans you choose to save under My plans;</li>
        <li>your light or dark theme choice, and your best score per country.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        None of this is sent anywhere. Clear your browser's site data to remove it. A plan only leaves your device if you
        share its link or image yourself.
      </p>

      <h2>Together</h2>
      <p>
        If you plan with a group in Together, the group's plan is encrypted in your browser and only the encrypted data is
        sent to our server. The key stays in the link and never reaches us. Groups are deleted automatically after the trip
        months pass, or after 180 days without changes.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We count page views with <a href="https://rybbit.io">Rybbit</a>, which we host ourselves. It doesn't use cookies,
        doesn't build a profile of you, and records pages visited, referrers, and rough location from your IP address,
        which isn't stored.
      </p>

      <h2>Offline use</h2>
      <p>
        The site installs a service worker so pages and holiday data you've visited keep working offline. It only stores
        files from leavemaxxing.com.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Reach Jonathan Borg through <a href="https://jonathanborg.net">jonathanborg.net</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
